= Pool

== Lane 1

// The sequence flow at this point shall continue at another point
// (in another lane). Hence we need the arrow and a custom label to
// define where we want our process to continue.
# Start ->l1

. End <-l2

== Lane 2

// This is the continuation for `->l1`.
- Activity 1 <-l1
// In this example, we jump back into the first lane with the second
// activity. However, you could also do the jump with `->l2` directly
// from `Activity 1` by moving the label there
// (and removing `- Activity 2`).
- Activity 2 ->l2
